blurb = "Depicts Ushi-oni (\"ox demon\"), a yōkai that was said to reside near bodies of water and terrorizing the locals. It is usually depicted as a six-legged spider with a demonic fanged ox head, and is rumored to cooperate with another yōkai, the Nure-onna, to ambush and eat people."
